  - m_Id: 20283397143896064
    m_Localized: Queen alert!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20283431977590784
    m_Localized: How to move
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20283443461595136
    m_Localized: Swipe to move your King one square. Move onto an enemy to capture
      it!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20283410544697344
    m_Localized: "When a Pawn reaches the other end, it becomes a powerful Queen.
      Queens move in all directions \u2014 take it out first!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20284520999264256
    m_Localized: Item appeared!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20283341154131968
    m_Localized: An item has appeared on the board. Move onto it to pick it up. It
      restores your health!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20283235780632576
    m_Localized: Enemy turns
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20283325597458432
    m_Localized: Each piece moves on its own turn. Pieces with an arrow will move
      this turn. No arrow means they're waiting!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20283042519687168
    m_Localized: Combo bonus!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20283224984494080
    m_Localized: "Chain captures to boost your score multiplier. 5 combo x1.5 \u2192
      10 combo x2.0 \u2192 20 combo x5.0! Capture within 5 seconds to keep the chain
      going!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20287839469674496
    m_Localized: Got it!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
